  "observations": [
    "One pointer click on Fly east resets to paused Waypoint pilot, disturbed seed 42, step 0 and visible destination.",
    "One pointer click on Run completes desktop waypoint flight at step 500, Time limit, height 2.00 m and distance 0.01 m in the displayed HUD.",
    "At narrow width, pointer Reset restores step 0 and retains the waypoint pilot. Pointer Run completes step 500 with the same final HUD values while recording.",
    "The initial drone and destination, and the arrived drone, remain above the controls at both inspected viewport sizes. No horizontal document overflow.",
    "Pointer Fail front left during waypoint flight produces smoke and a crash with debris. This recorded episode ends at step 204, displayed height 0.29 m and distance 1.89 m.",
    "Pointer Reset after the damaged episode restores the intact drone and waypoint pilot at step 0."
  ],
  "regressions": {
    "rapid_pointer_press": "Before the fix, a new hover plus press and release in one frame left steps at 0 instead of 1. Press now uses the current hover target. The test exercises PickingPlugin and InteractionPlugin, then asserts exactly one step after two updates.",
